EY LEGEND<LF>                                     19 *   ROW 24     STATUS LINE (STATE AND RECORD COUNT)<LF>                                     20 *<LF>                                     21 * NOTES:<LF>                                     22 *   MAXIMUM 200 RECORDS (RECFM=FB LRECL=80) HELD IN MEMORY            *<LF>                                     23 *   PDS MEMBERS:  RDJFCB + OPEN TYPE=J INJECTS MEMBER NAME AT +44     *<LF>                                     24 *   SEQUENTIAL:   STANDARD OPEN, NO JFCB MANIPULATION                 *<LF>                                     25 *   SVC 99 ALLOCATES DDNAME SYSASMEU AT STARTUP                       *<CR><LF>                                     26 *   SVC 99 KEY X'0004' STATUS DISPOSITION CODES:                      *<LF>                                     27 *     X'01'=NEW  X'02'=OLD  X'03'=MOD  X'04'=SHR                     *<LF>                                     28 *   SAVE USES OLD FOR EXISTING MEMBER/FILE, MOD TO CREATE NEW         *<LF>                                     29 *<LF>                                     30 * DEBUG OUTPUT (REMOVE WHEN STABLE):<LF>                                     31 *   THREE TSO SCROLL-MODE LINES ARE WRITTEN BEFORE FULLSCREEN MODE.   *<LF>                                     32 *   THEY SHOW THE PARSED DSN, MEMBER, AND DYNALL RESULT SO YOU CAN    *<LF>                                     33 *   VERIFY PARSE AND ALLOCATION ARE CORRECT.                          *<LF>                                     34 *   TO SUPPRESS: REMOVE THE TWO BAL R14,DBGOUT / BAL R14,DBGDYN CALLS*<LF>                                     35 *   AND THE DBGOUT/DBGDYN SUBROUTINES AND THEIR WORKING STORAGE.      *<LF>                                     36 * ------------------------------------------------------------------ *<LF>                                     37 *<LF>                                     38 * REGISTER EQUATES<LF>                                     39 *<LF>                      